# This legacy shell configuration described a fixed storage layout. It is not
# read by backup.sh or update-all.sh anymore. Do not create backup.conf from
# this file. Configure the exact mounted backup filesystem through the private
# Settings panel, or copy portable-backup.json.example to
# /srv/docker/configs/portable-backup.json and set its UUID, mount, folder and
# include_bulk values. See BACKUPS.md and docs/PORTABLE-BACKUP.md.
